    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p>We know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>Y</mi></math>,</p><p>Now using the above formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p>Now to solve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;let us assume a universal set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8709;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Negation of statement<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
